era_reference.sql is a translation (SQL Server to PostgreSQL, with the changes listed at its top)
of two files from OHDSI/ETL-Synthea (https://github.com/OHDSI/ETL-Synthea), branch main, commit
9ee6eb1b933c70af7b80711332aa92327af1f7c5:

  inst/sql/sql_server/cdm_version/v540/insert_condition_era.sql
  inst/sql/sql_server/cdm_version/v540/insert_drug_era.sql

which take their SQL from OHDSI/ETL-CMS (https://github.com/OHDSI/ETL-CMS),
SQL/create_CDMv5_condition_era.sql and SQL/create_CDMv5_drug_era_non_stockpile.sql.

